in actually doing that.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:18.489
Now, on the public option, health care is
he did covid stimulus and that tweaked Obamacare

00:04:18.489 --> 00:04:19.829
to some degree.

00:04:19.829 --> 00:04:22.860
And now he's got infrastructure, the jobs
plan, tax reform.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:28.190
I am still open to the idea that Joe Biden
will make a good faith effort to put a public

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.430
option in place.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.740
He may not do it.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:34.340
