not really trying giving that's not really

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.880
giving a good faith effort.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:19.340
If he puts together a proposal with Democrats
that want it and it includes a public option,

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:23.500
and when whoever Joe Manchin or whatever comes
out and says, I don't want that, he brings

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:27.560
them to the White House and he meets and any
lobbies and he pushes, I think we will all

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.210
know whether it was a good faith effort or
not.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:34.010
